{"seq":2,"slug":"windowing-model","title":"窗口化模型","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/foundations/windowing-model","wordCount":1353,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"窗口化模型\">窗口化模型</h1><p><a href=\"why-virtualization\">为何虚拟化</a> 已经论证了「只渲染可见行」能把渲染成本从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 压到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。但「只渲染可见行」是个口号，把它变成能跑的代码，需要一个精确的抽象。这个抽象就是窗口化模型：它由三个互相咬合的部件组成——一个撑起正确滚动高度的<strong>总尺寸容器</strong>、一个随滚动移动的<strong>可见窗口</strong>、以及把窗口里的元素摆到正确像素位置的<strong>偏移变换</strong>。理解了这三件套，你就理解了所有虚拟化库的内核。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-总尺寸-窗口-偏移三件套\">核心概念：总尺寸、窗口、偏移三件套</h2><p>把一个虚拟列表拆开，永远是这三层结构：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>总尺寸（total size）</strong>：一个高度等于全部 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 行总高的占位容器。它本身不渲染任何行内容，存在的唯一目的是让浏览器的原生滚动条长度正确——用户拖到滚动条中间，就该看到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n/2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mord\">/2</span></span></span></span></span> 行附近。定高时总高 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H = n \\cdot h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>；变高时是所有行高之和。</li>\n<li><strong>可见窗口（window）</strong>：当前真正渲染进 DOM 的那一小段连续索引 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">[s, e]</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span></span></span></span></span>。窗口随滚动位置移动，但其长度（节点数）始终是常数级。</li>\n<li><strong>偏移变换（offset transform）</strong>：窗口里的元素并不在文档流的「自然」位置，必须用偏移把它们摆到第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 行该在的像素高度上，否则它们会全挤在容器顶部。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>三者的关系可以这样想象：总尺寸是一条很长的卷尺，窗口是卷尺上一段可移动的高亮区，偏移则是把高亮区里印好的内容对齐到卷尺刻度的那个动作。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;  A[滚动容器 viewport:固定高度 + overflow:auto] --&gt; B[内层 sizer:高度 = 总尺寸 H]&#10;  B --&gt; C[偏移层:translateY 或 top = 窗口起始偏移]&#10;  C --&gt; D[窗口内的真实 DOM 行:索引 s..e]&#10;  A -.scroll 事件.-&gt; E[重算窗口 s..e 与起始偏移]&#10;  E --&gt; C\">flowchart TD\n  A[滚动容器 viewport:固定高度 + overflow:auto] --&gt; B[内层 sizer:高度 = 总尺寸 H]\n  B --&gt; C[偏移层:translateY 或 top = 窗口起始偏移]\n  C --&gt; D[窗口内的真实 DOM 行:索引 s..e]\n  A -.scroll 事件.-&gt; E[重算窗口 s..e 与起始偏移]\n  E --&gt; C</pre><h2 id=\"dom-结构-双层容器\">DOM 结构：双层容器</h2><p>落到 HTML 上，最经典的实现是「双层容器」：外层是固定高度、<code>overflow: auto</code> 的视口；内层是一个高度被显式设为总尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span> 的占位元素，它把滚动条撑到正确长度；窗口内的行作为内层的子节点，靠绝对定位或 transform 摆放。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"css\" data-code=\".viewport {&#10;  height: 600px;&#10;  overflow-y: auto;&#10;  position: relative;&#10;}&#10;.sizer {&#10;  height: var(--total-height);&#10;  position: relative;&#10;}&#10;.row {&#10;  position: absolute;&#10;  top: 0;&#10;  left: 0;&#10;  right: 0;&#10;  transform: translateY(var(--row-offset));&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.viewport</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">600</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">px</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  overflow-y</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">auto</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">relative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.sizer</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--total-height</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">relative</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">.row</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  position</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">absolute</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  top</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  left</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  right</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">  transform</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">: </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">translateY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">var</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">--row-offset</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">));</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>为什么用 <code>transform: translateY</code> 而不是改 <code>top</code>？因为 <code>transform</code> 通常只触发合成（compositing），不触发布局（layout），在频繁滚动重摆时更省。这一权衡的底层原因——哪些属性走合成、哪些触发重排——由渲染内部 hub 主讲，见 <a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/compositing\">合成</a>。</p>\n<p>还有一种实现用「上下两个空白占位 spacer」代替绝对定位：在窗口前面放一个高度等于「前 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span></span></span></span></span> 行总高」的空 div，窗口后面放一个高度等于「后面剩余行总高」的空 div，窗口行就用普通文档流排在中间。两种方案等价，spacer 方案对原生 <code>overflow-anchor</code> 更友好（见 <a href=\"../mechanics/scroll-anchoring\">滚动锚定与跳动</a>）。</p>\n<h2 id=\"从滚动位置到窗口-核心映射\">从滚动位置到窗口：核心映射</h2><p>窗口化模型的全部计算，归结为两个互逆的映射：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>索引 → 偏移</strong>：第 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span></span></span></span></span> 行的顶部像素位置 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。定高时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>offset</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>i</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>=</mo><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{offset}(i) = i \\cdot h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offset</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li><strong>偏移 → 索引</strong>：给定 <code>scrollTop</code>，找出它落在第几行。定高时 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>s</mi><mo>=</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">s = \\lfloor \\text{scrollTop} / h \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>定高列表里这两个映射都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的算术。下表对比定高与变高下三个关键量的复杂度——这正是机制章要展开的分叉点：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>量</th>\n<th>定高列表</th>\n<th>变高列表</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>总尺寸 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n \\cdot h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4445em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>所有行高之和，需累积</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>偏移→索引</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌊</mo><mtext>scrollTop</mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>h</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">⌋</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\lfloor \\text{scrollTop}/h \\rfloor</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">⌊</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">scrollTop</span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mclose\">⌋</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>前缀和上二分，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>索引→偏移</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>i</mi><mo>⋅</mo><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">i \\cdot h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6595em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">⋅</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span>，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>查前缀和，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>变高时这两个映射不再是简单乘除，要靠前缀和与二分，并且行高在渲染前未知、得边量边修——这套机制是 <a href=\"../mechanics/fixed-vs-variable-height\">定高与变高</a> 与 <a href=\"../mechanics/measurement-caching\">测量与缓存</a> 的主题，本篇只确立「窗口化依赖这两个映射」这个框架。</p>\n<h2 id=\"状态最小化-模型只需三个输入\">状态最小化：模型只需三个输入</h2><p>一个干净的窗口化实现，其全部输出（该渲染哪些行、各摆在哪）都由三个输入决定：当前 <code>scrollTop</code>、视口高度 <code>viewportHeight</code>、以及高度信息（定高的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>h</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">h</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span></span></span></span></span> 或变高的高度数组）。这意味着虚拟化器本质是一个纯函数：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>render</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">{</mo><mtext>window</mtext><mo>:</mo><mo stretchy=\"false\">[</mo><mi>s</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>e</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">]</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext> offsets</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">}</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{render}(scrollTop, viewportHeight, heights) \\rightarrow \\{ \\text{window}: [s, e],\\ \\text{offsets} \\}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">render</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">{</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">window</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mopen\">[</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mclose\">]</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">offsets</span></span><span class=\"mclose\">}</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>把它写成纯函数有两个好处：一是滚动时只需重算这个函数，没有隐藏状态导致的撕裂；二是可测试——给定输入断言输出，无需真实 DOM。这也是 TanStack Virtual 这类 headless 库的设计哲学：库只负责算窗口，渲染交给你（见 <a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a>）。框架信号/响应式如何驱动这个纯函数的重算，可参考 <a href=\"../../frontend-reactivity-signals/practice/signals-and-rendering\">信号与渲染</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>窗口化模型 = 总尺寸容器（撑滚动条）+ 可见窗口（常数个真实节点）+ 偏移变换（摆到正确像素位）。</li>\n<li>典型 DOM 是双层容器：固定高视口套一个高度为总尺寸的 sizer，窗口行用 <code>transform: translateY</code> 摆放（走合成不走布局）；spacer 方案是等价替代。</li>\n<li>模型的核心是两个互逆映射：索引→偏移、偏移→索引；定高下都是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，变高下要靠前缀和与二分。</li>\n<li>一个好的虚拟化器是纯函数 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>render</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>s</mi><mi>c</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>l</mi><mi>T</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>p</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>v</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>w</mi><mi>p</mi><mi>o</mi><mi>r</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>H</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>h</mi><mi>e</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mi>t</mi><mi>s</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{render}(scrollTop, viewportHeight, heights)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">render</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">scr</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0197em;\">l</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">T</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">o</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0269em;\">w</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">or</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">e</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">h</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">t</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">s</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>，无隐藏状态、可测试，这也是 headless 库的设计基础。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h2><ul>\n<li>把映射算到具体数字：<a href=\"viewport-overscan\">可见区与过扫描</a></li>\n<li>变高如何打破 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(1)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>：<a href=\"../mechanics/fixed-vs-variable-height\">定高与变高</a>、<a href=\"../mechanics/measurement-caching\">测量与缓存</a></li>\n<li>谁帮你算窗口：<a href=\"../practice/virtualization-libraries\">虚拟化库选型</a></li>\n<li>跨库——为何用 transform 摆放：<a href=\"../../browser-rendering-internals/pipeline/compositing\">合成</a></li>\n<li>跨库——响应式驱动重算：<a href=\"../../frontend-reactivity-signals/practice/signals-and-rendering\">信号与渲染</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"窗口化模型","id":"窗口化模型"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：总尺寸、窗口、偏移三件套","id":"核心概念-总尺寸-窗口-偏移三件套"},{"level":2,"text":"DOM 结构：双层容器","id":"dom-结构-双层容器"},{"level":2,"text":"从滚动位置到窗口：核心映射","id":"从滚动位置到窗口-核心映射"},{"level":2,"text":"状态最小化：模型只需三个输入","id":"状态最小化-模型只需三个输入"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":2,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"为何虚拟化","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/foundations/why-virtualization"},"next":{"title":"可见区与过扫描","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/frontend-virtualization-windowing/foundations/viewport-overscan"}}